Z||000000||FieroLisa||02-12-2001||10:42 PM||||OK so I think I've decided the general color I want for my car- a deep dark blue with a purplish tint. I've heard people say Lotus has this color but does anyone know of any other manufacturer's colors that are sorta kinda like this?<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 gold 4 speed GT<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>Tarheels Fieros Website</A><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/pffsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
